{
  "name": "slug",
  "_about": "A large red slug (Arion rufus), 12 cm long: a long soft body gliding on a flat sole fringed paler, its back finely wrinkled in long ridges; a saddle-like mantle over the front third with the breathing pore on its right side; two long eye tentacles with black eyes at their tips and two short feelers below them; the tail rounded. Coats: the black slug (Arion ater), the leopard slug (Limax maximus: grey, black-spotted, a keel down the tail). Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/insects/soft.py on insectlib.py (one smooth body on a chain of bones that ripples as it crawls).",
